# The inline mock maker is required by M_Delivery_Planning_GenerateShortageOverageClosedGuardTest:
# it mocks de.metas.handlingunits.inventory.InventoryRepository, which is a final class, and the
# default subclass mock maker cannot mock final classes.
#
# Note this file ships INSIDE the module's test-jar (pom.xml builds one), so any module that ever
# depends on de.metas.deliveryplanning.base's test-jar inherits the inline mock maker for ALL of its
# own tests. No module does today; check this before adding such a dependency.
#
# Mockito reads the first non-empty line and strips everything from '#'
# (org.mockito.internal.configuration.plugins.PluginFileReader), so these comments are inert.
mock-maker-inline
